'' RUN: a float constant CAST to an integer type -- 'cast( ulong, 0.5 * 255.f )' -- folds half to
'' even, in the integer constant folder itself: a shared UDT table built with
'' D3DCOLOR_COLORVALUE's shape had no value for the leaf and declined (TKO0994; fbc examples
'' win32/d3d9_primitives), and a const of one had none. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/const-cast-float-to-int.bas -o tests/codegen/constcastfloattoint.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/constcastfloattoint.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/constcastfloattoint.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: FFFF8000 800000FF 6-2 2
